{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7468922143619812626.003","text":"あなたを小さくする関係を見抜いて、守るべき人と時間に集中するための5つのサイン。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468922143619812626","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T15:06:15.261520Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":7,"conflict":8,"quotability":8,"practical_value":9,"total":40},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468922143619812626","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7468080597261470983.001","text":"その悪意に反応する前に、心を守るための「受け流し方」を一つ決めておこう。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T15:09:27.614459Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":7,"quotability":8,"practical_value":8,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7468080597261470983.002","text":"言い返しても心が軽くならないなら、相手を変えるより先に、自分の境界線を引き直す方法があります。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T15:09:27.614459Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":9,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":8,"quotability":8,"practical_value":9,"total":42},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7468080597261470983.003","text":"誰かの不機嫌を背負って一日を潰さないために、傷ついた直後にできる心の切り替えを紹介します。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T15:09:27.614459Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":9,"conflict":7,"quotability":8,"practical_value":9,"total":41},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7468080597261470983","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469555236407872776.001","text":"返信の遅さを嫌われた証拠に変えないために、心が暴走する前の考え方を一つ持っておこう。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T20:32:49.547910Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":8,"quotability":7,"practical_value":8,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469555236407872776.002","text":"終わった関係を何度も心の中で再生してしまう人へ。過去ではなく、今日の自分に意識を戻す小さな習慣があります。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T20:32:49.547910Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":7,"quotability":8,"practical_value":8,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469555236407872776.003","text":"画面の向こうの一言に一日を奪われる前に。反応する相手と、手放す相手を見分ける基準を知っていますか？","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-01T20:32:49.547910Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":9,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":8,"quotability":8,"practical_value":7,"total":40},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469555236407872776","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.001","text":"気分が重い場所から抜け出せないときは、考え方より先に“明るい刺激”を入れる。心の空気を変える小さなリセット習慣。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":7,"quotability":8,"practical_value":8,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.002","text":"誰かの不機嫌を受け取ってしまった日は、無理に前向きにならなくていい。五感を使って、自分の気分を自分の場所へ戻す方法があります。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":9,"conflict":8,"quotability":8,"practical_value":9,"total":42},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.003","text":"嫌な空気に飲まれたまま帰宅しないために。部屋に入った瞬間、自分の心を切り替える三分間の儀式を決めておこう。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":9,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":8,"quotability":9,"practical_value":9,"total":43},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7556571246406765832.001","text":"努力しても空回りする日は、現実を押し切るより「今日は何を期待しないか」を決めると、次の一歩が見えてくる。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7556571246406765832","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-02T02:46:26.181770Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":8,"quotability":8,"practical_value":7,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7556571246406765832","evidence_null_reason":null}
{"schema_version":"marketing.hook.v1","id":"hook.tiktok.7556571246406765832.002","text":"不安の正体は、出来事より「こうなるはず」にしがみつくこと。期待を一つ手放すだけで、心の消耗は減らせます。","language":"ja","product_ids":["ebook-ja"],"source_type":"video","source_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7556571246406765832","source_null_reason":null,"captured_at":"2026-08-02T02:46:26.181770Z","provenance":"live_observed","rubric":{"hook":8,"emotional_peak":8,"conflict":7,"quotability":8,"practical_value":8,"total":39},"status":"active","ewma_score":null,"observations":0,"evidence_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7556571246406765832","evidence_null_reason":null}
